# Process 4, the body of draw.Views.

{3. Load and index the code}
> design
[4.1. Align the versions of each diagram line by line
 so the Diff view shows only what changed
 (draw.align)]
> design, code index, alignments
[4.2. Link both versions and the patch of each diagram
 so dfd draws references, typed items and terms as links
 (draw.link)]
> sheets, footnote definitions, dfd command
[4.3. Run dfd for each view
 (draw.render)]
> views
{5. Write the page}

# type: design = *design.Design
# type: code index = *code.Index
# type: alignments = map[string][]dfdtext.Op
# type: sheets = []draw.sheet
# type: footnote definitions = map[string]string
# type: dfd command = draw.Command
# type: views = []draw.View
